{
 "title": "Meet LayerCue: The Main Window — LayerCue from Zero, Episode 1",
 "goalLine": "By the end you'll know every part of the LayerCue window, and you'll have seen layers in action.",
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "chapter": "What LayerCue is",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hi there! This is LayerCue.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "It puts your show on the big screen, in layers.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "It runs on Mac and Windows.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Here, a video runs underneath.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Words sit on top.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And a logo stays up in the corner.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Each one comes and goes on its own.",
     "pause": 0.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "In this episode, we'll walk around the main window.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Today we just look.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "You won't send anything out yet.",
     "pause": 0.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "chapter": "The four areas",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The window has four areas.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The sidebar on the left.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Your slides in the middle.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The stage band across the top.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And the status bar along the bottom.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Here's an easy way to remember it.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Pick on the left.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Click in the middle.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Watch the top.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Adjust on the right.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Adjust means Slide settings, at the far right of the band.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "chapter": "The sidebar",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Let's start on the left.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Cue Sheets are at the top.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "A cue sheet is the running order for one event.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "This one, Tour, lines up six short guides.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Below the line is the Library drawer.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "A library is a folder of presentations.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And a presentation is one set of slides.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The number on the right is how many slides it has.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press the double arrow to pull the drawer up.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press it again to lower it.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Just pointing at it won't raise it.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "chapter": "The middle: slides",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now I'll click Start here, inside the Tour cue sheet.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The middle shows every presentation in it, in order.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Each one has a title bar with its name and slide count.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "On the right are five buttons.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Add File.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Link.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Edit.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Layer for this list.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And Presentation settings.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Below the bar are the slide cards.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Under each picture, you'll see its kind and its name.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Here's the big one: a click on the picture sends it out.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "No confirmation, no second step.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "So we won't click any pictures today.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "That's Episode 3.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "chapter": "The top band",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Up top is where you watch the stage.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The tile on the left is Screen 1.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Here it's a virtual screen, so no projector is needed.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The switch at the right end turns the output on and off.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Under the preview, Layers shown picks what this monitor shows.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Beside the preview, the layer column shows what's up right now.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Clear at the top, then seven layers.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Five overlays.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "F for foreground.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And B for background.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Next comes the sound meter.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Then Music, which has its own channel.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And at the right end, Slide settings.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Option-click a slide to look at it here, without sending it.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "chapter": "The status bar",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The status bar reads from left to right.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Show and Edit.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The On air chip counts the monitors that are showing.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The speaker box is your sound device.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The dot and title tell you what's on stage.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Tell us what's wrong sends us a note.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The slider changes the card size.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The pencil is Lock editing.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And the gear opens Settings.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "chapter": "Layers, in a demo",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now let's see layers in action.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "This demo is scripted, and the event is made up.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "A video goes to the background.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The B cell turns amber.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Words go on top, in the foreground.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "F turns indigo.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "A logo goes to overlay one.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And cell 1 turns green.",
     "pause": 0.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Now I'll change the words.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The video keeps playing.",
     "pause": 0.3,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The little x next to F takes just the words down.",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "That's the whole idea of layers!",
     "pause": 0.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
