 ],
 "descriptionYouTube": "A friendly four-minute tour of the LayerCue main window: what every part is called, what it does, and how layers work.\nNot installed yet? Episode 2 walks you through it, on Mac and Windows.\nNo prior episode needed.\nLost? Start with Episode 1.\nRecorded on LayerCue 0.9.12.\nNo account is needed to run a show; Settings needs a one-time Google sign-in.\nManual: https://layercue.com/docs/start/tour/\nThe narration is AI-generated and the music is built from GarageBand loops. The event in the demo, Riverside Tech Summit 2026, is fictional; the demo is scripted on a virtual screen.",
 "version": 2
}